architecture "A small web service"
node Browser role=external tag=WEB sublabel="Customer interface"
node API role=backend tag=CORE sublabel="Request handling"
node Database role=store tag=SQL sublabel="Durable records"
node Cache role=optional tag=FAST sublabel="Recent responses"
Browser -> API: HTTPS
API => Database: read and write
API -> Cache: lookup
group Runtime: API, Database, Cache
highlight API
